#: tastenbrett/main.cpp:139
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"The keyboard geometry failed to load. This often indicates that the selected "
"model does not support a specific layout or layout variant. This problem "
"will likely also present when you try to use this combination of model, "
"layout and variant.\n"
"Previewing layouts that are defined outside your systems xkb directory is "
"not supported and  will also trigger this message. These might still work "
"fine if applied"
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu da učitam geometriju tastature. Ovo često znači da izabrani model ne "
"podržava određeni raspored ili varijantu rasporeda. Isti problem će se "
"vjerovatno javiti i kada pokušate da koristite ovu kombinaciju modela, "
"rasporeda i varijante.\n"
"Pregled rasporeda definisanih van sistemske fascikle xkb nije podržan i "
"takođe izaziva ovu poruku. Takvi rasporedi ipak mogu ispravno da rade kada "
"se primijene"

