msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"You can have up to 4 main layouts, all other layouts are spare. Spare "
"layouts are not included when cycling through the layouts, but can be "
"accessed through the keyboard indicator applet or by setting a custom "
"shortcut."
msgstr ""
"Možete imati do 4 glavna rasporeda, a svi ostali rasporedi su rezervni. "
"Rezervni rasporedi se ne uključuju pri kruženju kroz rasporede, ali im se "
"može pristupiti preko apleta pokazatelja tastature ili postavljanjem posebne "
"prečice."

